        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DoralLock TK6901, Portland Knob Trim Kit for Handlesets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA perfect enhancement for traditional or contemporary homes, the Portland Knob is made from brass and it is available in 7 finishes. The rounded design is proportioned to comfortably fit the palm of the hand. The Portland Knob Inside Trim Kit used with the DoralLock <a href=\"/products/hanover-single-cylinder-handleset-dorallock-803871b\">Hanover Handleset</a> and the <a href=\"/products/single-cylinder-montego-handleset-dorallock-810871\">Montego Handleset</a>. This is an replacement inside handle kit for these handelsets only as it is just the lever and rosette.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here or a complete <a href=\"/products/portland-door-knobset-dorallock-6900\">Portland Knob Set</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the DoralLock TK6901 Portland Knob Trim Kit:\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-TK6901-specifications.pdf?v=1704262208\" target=\"new\"><b>DoralLock TK6901 Portland Trim Kit (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
